subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Review upcoming renewals, bills, and trials

USAGE:
  subtrack review <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                             Display this help message
  -v, --version                          Display this version
  --billDays <billDays>                  
  --contractDays <contractDays>          
  --trialDays <trialDays>                
  -j, --json                             

